      "reading": {
        "title": "A short connected story",
        "paragraphs": [
          {
            "hanzi": "小明会唱歌，也喜欢看电影。今天他很忙，不能去电影院。明天他想和朋友一起去。",
            "pinyin": "Xiǎomíng huì chàng gē, yě xǐhuan kàn diànyǐng. Jīntiān tā hěn máng, bù néng qù diànyǐngyuàn. Míngtiān tā xiǎng hé péngyou yìqǐ qù.",
            "english": "Xiaoming can sing and also likes movies. He is busy today and cannot go to the cinema. Tomorrow he wants to go with a friend."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "他今天不去电影院。",
